{"id":"HAD-0173","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"Ǧubayr ibn Muṭʿim berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"**Wer die Verwandtschaftsbande abbricht, wird das Paradies nicht betreten.**","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī, Nr. 5984","grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":"Ebenfalls in Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim, Nr. 2556."}